Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.03,0:00:03.04,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Afternoon, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:07.00,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Tomorrow starts your long awaited summer vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:09.75,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Those of you who are going to the ocean, mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.07,0:00:12.46,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,rivers, valleys, and PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:15.42,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,make sure to fully enjoy your youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:19.01,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,and deepen your friendships!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.89,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:23.58,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Remember to do your homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:27.05,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You'd better not forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.06,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,That's all. Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:34.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's summer vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:36.48,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Nao, let's have a lot of fun this summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.74,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Of course! {Yeah, let's do it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:40.74,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,And I can go to PriPara with you this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll go to PriPara, and the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:47.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,and PriPara, and the pool, and PriPara, and the pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:49.86,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Um... What about our homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:51.42,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Midorikaze-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:53.94,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Even though you're starting summer vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:57.56,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,we will be continuing our Princess lessons every day as per usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.38,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:02.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.71,0:01:05.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari sure is fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.18,0:02:40.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A Date with Prince and the Goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.15,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}And a un, deux, trois. {people will understand, surely}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:45.95,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:47.91,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.87,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:52.14,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:54.82,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Elegant and beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:57.31,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:59.30,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I will rise to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:02.83,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,A sparkling, gorgeous celeb princess!{28}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:06.93,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,And to do that requires heart, technique, and physique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:10.39,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You must wholeheartedly become a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:15.39,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,It seems you still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:20.78,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,However, compared to when you started, you've made a lot of progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:23.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Miss Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:27.57,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I'm being{orig: going to be} tough on you since I want you to win the GranPrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.11,0:03:29.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,GrandPrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:34.54,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,With whom should I form a five person team with, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:38.25,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I'm sure Hibiki-sama is figuring that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:41.70,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Anyway, that is all for today's lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:45.22,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,After this, you should practise what we've worked on today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.68,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.97,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Now then, have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:55.39,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:04:01.44,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We're here to determine the additional two members who will join us...{This meeting is to decide on our five person team so that we can secure...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:03.90,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...in the Summer Dream Idol GrandPrix-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:06.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,First, we've already agreed on Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:08.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We haven't asked her yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:10.54,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Lala, we'll leave that to you-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:14.09,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It seems you're the one who talks to her the most-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:15.31,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:17.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The other could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.89,Default-Alt,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:18.89,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,...Nanami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:20.76,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I don't think so-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:24.59,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Iroha already turned us down...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:26.85,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:30.32,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The one we put on a passionate concert with that one time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:33.72,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Didn't she join with New & Mew and that other girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.81,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,They're already of one mind and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:40.34,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I guess this time we'll try leaving it to our manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.83,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:43.77,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We've already decided on Fuwari, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:46.23,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Go and find someone for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:49.74,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Someone who is highly skilled and will join us and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:51.45,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.85,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You say that, but with how much I've had to tend to Dressing Parfait recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.91,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I've been completely unmotivated to go out scouting-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:05:02.05,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's a manager's job to scout others-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:05.37,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But to find someone who can win...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:08.47,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to bring someone in from outside PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:11.18,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Woah, we can do something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:13.26,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Impossible-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:16.81,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,As you can probably tell, I don't have that many connections-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,3,0,0,0,,{groan}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:19.89,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:27.86,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Elegant and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:30.69,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.99,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I will rise to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:37.98,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And become a sparkling gorgeous celeb princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:41.70,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That's wonderful-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:45.84,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko saw a sparkling princess-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:50.68,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Compared to Fuwari, Toriko is a plain, worthless, overshadowed piece of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:52.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Hey, Toriko,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:56.39,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder what "rise to the top" actually means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:06:00.05,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It means that everyone else is below you-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:03.10,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You'd be a princess that will stand at the top-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:07.39,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Compared to that, Toriko is a plain, worthless, overshadowed piece of rubbish...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:10.32,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Isn't that lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:12.09,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.09,0:06:15.99,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be lonely to stand above everyone else?{Wouldn't I be alone if I stood above everyone else?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to be with everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:24.92,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Fuwari, but then you wouldn't be a princess-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:35.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama's Making Drama is truly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:38.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I sparkle and shine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:42.82,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But I'm not understanding it any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's the right fit for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:47.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:49.42,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:52.19,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wait, did you just speak like a human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.91,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Lala, why are you at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:07:00.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I came because I wanted to ask you to join our Dream Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:02.37,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Ah! Why are you here, Lala!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.13,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dorthy-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You're trying to get the jump on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:10.46,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's like I keep saying, Fuwari's joining Dressing Parfait, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:14.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?! I want her to join SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:16.68,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:20.90,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,To put it simply, having the princess candidate join your team would be a cheap way to win.{it'd be pretty cheap of you to win by having the princess candidate join your team.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:22.05,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Same goes to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.97,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,No, we're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,How are you different?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:29.27,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can become the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:29.98,Default,Lathy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:36.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So Shikyouin-san gave you a Making Drama as a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:37.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:40.58,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,However, it's not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:46.42,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Something like the "world is my oyster" doesn't really seem like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Eh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:52.45,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Well, "the world is my oyster" is something I can max agree with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:55.40,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I do have the qualities of a princess, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dorthy-san...{109}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:08:00.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Maybe someone more suitable like Dorthy should be the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.38,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:04.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Then let's go talk to Shikyouin-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:07.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I don't think that's what she meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:15.28,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,All right, Hibiki-san, give us a sharp gaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:19.20,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great. Show more emotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:20.87,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Yes, that'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:22.37,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:23.91,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:27.66,Default-Alt,Photo,0,0,0,,All right, thank you, everyone. We're done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:28.92,Default-Alt,Girl,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.74,Default-Alt,Photo,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:31.72,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.88,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.54,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:48.27,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:02.26,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:05.99,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:08.29,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm so busy and can't see you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:14.46,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Could these roses possibly be enough to beg your forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:16.47,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:21.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:26.38,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Your lack of sentence enders soothes my beating heart.{can't remember what actually made it to release last time}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:28.36,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The one who knows not of uncleanliness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,with a heart of pure white,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:32.15,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and is the ultimate princess candidate,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.86,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,would you go on a date with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:46.33,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:47.16,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:53.33,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Let's perform the Making Drama I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:54.48,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:03.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Is this really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:08.60,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,A beautiful dress fitting of a beautiful princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.31,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And to top it off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:12.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:19.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.59,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:26.97,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I humbly receive this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.67,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This is the spoon you use for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.31,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.07,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:43.76,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Your smile is as the summer sun, sparkling through the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:46.22,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:51.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You're so radiant, even the lobster is blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:51.98,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:58.19,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Beautiful girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:01.26,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to dance with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:03.15,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.94,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,They're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:09.08,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:14.46,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This step...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:16.17,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This sense of rhythm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.38,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Look how good you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:23.07,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:26.59,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}...really be?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:32.36,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I've been lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:35.76,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As I am known as a prince in this glamorous world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:38.52,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,all the women who approach me are nothing but shams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:43.64,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Ah, how love's tender touch has escaped my grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:46.04,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As have the roses of passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.49,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,But I have finally found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:55.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Take my hand and become the true princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:11.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to your concert tomorrow, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:14.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Show me the you who has been dyed in my colour. {this sentence bugs me, but i have no idea how else to phrase it... it's not too bad though - dawn}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:16.48,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:33.09,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Keep them balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:34.78,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Stand up straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:35.62,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:38.31,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're doing wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:46.21,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Do your feet hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:48.59,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're not even going to take them off during your break?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:50.15,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:54.06,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A princess must always wear elegant footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:01.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Elegant and beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:03.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world is my oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.24,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will rise above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:11.66,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Shine! Gorgeous Celeb Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:15.51,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:23.54,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wholeheartedly become a princess.{consistency with hell if I remember when}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:26.85,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world is my oyster...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:29.38,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That isn't wholehearted...{from my heart}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:35.47,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Someone tell me what I should do!{What should I do? Someone tell me!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:37.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:38.58,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Lala?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:41.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:44.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Um... What should I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:50.40,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I came here to become a princess, yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:54.12,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Lala, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:59.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,T-That's pretty difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:02.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:03.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:08.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Well, if you're not sure what to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:11.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,why don't you blow it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:12.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Blow it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:16.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,If you put everything into exercising,{By putting everything into moving your body,}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,and just concentrate on having fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:22.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,eventually you'll be like "Huh? What was I even worried about?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:24.73,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:28.53,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Ah! Lala's trying to get the jump on us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.19,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorthy, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dressing Parfait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:35.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's all go play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:36.43,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:38.37,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What's got into you suddenly?{What are you talking about all of a sudden?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:42.58,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,With the SummDrea so close, we don't have the ti{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:48.55,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,The Daruma has fallen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:57.47,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Lala-san has fallen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:59.43,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Max capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:59.43,Default,Lawana,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:04.90,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Mirelle-san has fallen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.33,Default,Lawana,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:08.35,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Gotcha...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:10.02,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You moved, Dorthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:11.17,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:11.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You did too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.88,0:15:12.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:15.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:13.69,Default-Alt,Shion,0,0,0,,You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:15.07,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.75,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Leona, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:29.59,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you want to go that way, Dorthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:31.27,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Fuwari, let's go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:32.83,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:35.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh my! I'm about to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:36.62,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:38.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Rawr! {too childish? grr is fine}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:39.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:45.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:56.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Now you're it, Fuwari-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.67,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:04.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I take you off for a little, shoes-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{sound of effort}{hahahaha great onomatopoeia}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:14.43,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:17.97,Default,4,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.68,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:23.56,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:25.52,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.23,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,She's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:32.52,Default,Doona,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:33.69,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:36.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:47.08,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You all came?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:48.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Let's race!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{sound of effort}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{sound of effort}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:20.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We climbed a tree together the first time I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:21.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:25.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I've always thought that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,...being with you is a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:29.83,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ever since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:30.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:34.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ever since the first time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:39.93,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're far more fascinating now than when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\1}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:45.35,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What are those two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:47.31,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:51.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. I forgot to practise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.66,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,From Fuwari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:07.45,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:10.42,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:15.90,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,A coord that represents the clear water and blue skies in the Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.91,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's a coord that Mother{not too attached to this, could be just the} Earth would love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:20.45,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Palps Sky Country Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:29.32,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, but please wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:33.12,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!{EP52}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:39.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Let's go!!{EP52}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:55.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A mysterious spring orchestra!!{EP52}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:20:01.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!!{EP52}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:34.14,Default-Alt,Fan1,0,0,0,,You're awesome, Fuwari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.14,0:20:36.21,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,You really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Fan3,0,0,0,,{goat sounds}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:39.78,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Fuwari-chan did really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:41.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:45.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I want her in SoLaMi Smile more and more-pri
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:46.93,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:48.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:52.99,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I am unaccustomed to waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.45,0:20:57.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We'll need to take drastic measures with the princess.{her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.39,0:21:12.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder if I upset Prince-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:08.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Celebrity 4?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:09.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.33,0:23:15.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's a group of four top idols that Prince-sama called to form a dream team with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.93,0:23:16.72,Default,Cera,0,0,0,,Cera.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:17.43,Default,Leika,0,0,0,,Leika.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:18.55,Default,Britney,0,0,0,,Britney.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.55,0:23:19.18,Default,Tyna,0,0,0,,Tyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:21.12,Default,Celeberty4,0,0,0,,We're Celebrity 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:22.68,Default,Celeberty4,0,0,0,,Gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:27.06,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Even if you try to strong-arm us, we won't give up Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:27.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:30.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Run! SummDrea GrandPrix!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:31.91,Default,Celeberty4,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:34.86,Default,Celeberty4,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
